WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.720
1,700 career criminals out, brought them back to where they came from,

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.120
the countries where they came from, or put them in jails.

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.840
Washington, D.C. is now a totally safe city again.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.080
And I welcome you to come.

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:15.640
In fact, we'll have dinner together at a local restaurant.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:17.520
And we'll be able to walk.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.480
We don't have to go by an armor-plated vehicle.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:23.000
We'll walk right over there from the White House.

